# PersonalClipboard

Local Windows dictation overlay. Audio, transcripts, clipboard, and LLM stay on this PC.

- No cloud STT/LLM, telemetry, or crash-report uploads. Ollama only at `127.0.0.1`.
- Master **enable switch ON**: capture + overlapping Whisper. VAD may stop the streaming mic while quiet (probe wakes it). **OFF**: stop capture, stop probe, idle CUDA.
- Latency-first: overlay partials under ~400 ms; clipboard commit under ~1 s after end of sentence.
- Never send partial ASR hypotheses to Ollama. Correct on sentence commit or `Ctrl+Shift+A` only. Type-field ghost completion may use the same localhost model while that field is focused (Tab accepts).
- Default models: Faster-Whisper `large-v3-turbo` FP16 on CUDA; `qwen2.5:1.5b` for correction so the 16 GB card keeps headroom.
- `Ctrl+Shift+A` reformats the current clipboard (works with capture off).
- `Ctrl+Shift+R` focuses Type; again returns focus to the last other-app text field (Explorer included).
- Do not persist microphone audio unless an explicit debug flag is on; never commit recordings.

See `AGENTS.md` and `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.
